cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use proc-sim-agent, please cite it as below."
title: "proc-sim-agent: an Agent Skill for Aspen Plus process simulation"
type: software
abstract: >-
  proc-sim-agent is an open-source Agent Skill (agentskills.io) that helps chemical engineers work
  in Aspen Plus with a coding agent such as Claude Code or GitHub Copilot. It grounds answers in
  the user's own locally installed Aspen Plus help and example library, simulation files and
  literature: a full-text index of the local help and of the example models; readers for run
  history, report, Control Panel and backup files, with a check that they come from the same run;
  stream balance and KPI checks against expected values; staged model building; an input-file
  writer workflow with a checker; inline-Fortran checks; Aspen Plus automation (COM) on copies of
  a model; and a curated knowledge base of run messages and calculator practice. No vendor content
  is distributed.
authors:
